 data/equipment/robot/weapons.json         |  39 ++++----
 data/equipment/weapons.json               | 113 +++++++++++++---------
 i18n/en-EN/data/system/damageEffects.json |   2 +-
 i18n/ru-RU/data/system/damageEffects.json |   2 +-
 4 files changed, 88 insertions(+), 68 deletions(-)

